rld download (:","body_tagged":"Now added the world download (:","created_at":1466473923},{"id":310896,"author":"_DISTRACTION_","body":"It would be a solid mini CTW if you removed the iron and gold. I think the map is a bit too small for different tiers of armor.","body_tagged":"It would be a solid mini CTW if you removed the iron and gold. I think the map is a bit too small for different tiers of armor.","created_at":1466479500},{"id":310934,"author":"JDKL","body":"It's looks great! :)","body_tagged":"It's looks great! :)","created_at":1466492158},{"id":310936,"author":"imryaan","body":"Very unique!\u003cbr\u003e+1","body_tagged":"Very unique!\u003cbr\u003e+1","created_at":1466492260},{"id":310938,"author":"Xuph","body":"The shape is really good\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaybe connect the last island from the wool to the wool room in order to create a lane to make defenses possible, also what _DISTRACTION_ said is right, add only gold.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOther than that i will mention again i really like the shape\u003cbr\u003eAesthetics are good\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRemove these little trees in the middle and leave the area flat without structures in order to prevent easy doublecapping/rushing just above the trees.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://image.prntscr.com/image/dd8ece69f36240608866f97cd0849f6a.png\" title=\"Image: http://image.prntscr.com/image/dd8ece69f36240608866f97cd0849f6a.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood map overall, good job","body_tagged":"The shape is really good\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaybe connect the last island from the wool to the wool room in order to create a lane to make defenses possible, also what _DISTRACTION_ said is right, add only gold.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOther than that i will mention again i really like the shape\u003cbr\u003eAesthetics are good\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRemove these little trees in the middle and leave the area flat without structures in order to prevent easy doublecapping/rushing just above the trees.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://image.prntscr.com/image/dd8ece69f36240608866f97cd0849f6a.png\" title=\"Image: http://image.prntscr.com/image/dd8ece69f36240608866f97cd0849f6a.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood map overall, good job","created_at":1466492696},{"id":310951,"author":"Crimson_Aught","body":"Nice map. I suggest to make distance between middle and side islands a little bit bigger.","body_tagged":"Nice map. I suggest to make distance between middle and side islands a little bit bigger.","created_at":1466494272},{"id":310965,"author":"Speeded","body":"Sugoi! +1","body_tagged":"Sugoi! +1","created_at":1466496299},{"id":311013,"author":"ProfessorUtonium","body":"y e s","body_tagged":"y e s","created_at":1466520135},{"id":311014,"author":"Legoche","body":"Looks great! I would say remove some trees though or make them smaller :)","body_tagged":"Looks great! I would say remove some trees though or make them smaller :)","created_at":1466520519},{"id":311015,"author":"LFT","body":"P L E A S E","body_tagged":"P L E A S E","created_at":1466520532},{"id":311046,"author":"MerlinMaster","body":"Seen it before","body_tagged":"Seen it before","created_at":1466525565},{"id":311160,"author":"Seuthy","body":"damn","body_tagged":"damn","created_at":1466550837},{"id":311219,"author":"Zintenka","body":"Damn son.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAwesome shape, perfect block palette and it's quite moderately sized.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis map looks pretty awesome man, you have my plus one :)","body_tagged":"Damn son.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAwesome shape, perfect block palette and it's quite moderately sized.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis map looks pretty awesome man, you have my plus one :)","created_at":1466570055},{"id":315548,"author":"Legoche","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica